\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Your profile reveals a fascinating and highly effective combination: a 
\f1\b Principled Pragmatist
\f0\b0 .\
\
The juxtaposition of elevated strategic detachment (Machiavellianism: 64, Psychopathy: 68) with strong moral and interpersonal guardrails (Humility: 75, Ethical Leadership: 68, Empathy: 61) suggests you are extremely cool under pressure, highly strategic, and unburdened by excessive anxiety, yet you consciously channel these traits toward ethical, team-oriented outcomes. Your low Sadism (43) and average Narcissism (46) confirm that you are driven by effectiveness rather than ego or a desire for dominance.\
\
You likely lead with "cognitive empathy"\'97understanding exactly what makes people tick and using that data to navigate organizational politics effectively, all while maintaining a strong internal compass. Your triggers likely include highly emotional, disorganized decision-making or performative workplace behaviors that lack practical utility.\
